      "sample_index": 0,
      "text": "To determine the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Convert the cost of the painting from Namibian dollars to US dollars.\n2. Convert the cost of the painting from US dollars to Chinese yuan.\n\nFirst, let's convert the cost of the painting from Namibian dollars to US dollars. We know that 1 US dollar is equivalent to 7 Namibian dollars. Therefore, we can find the number of US dollars equivalent to \\(105\\) Namibian dollars by dividing \\(105\\) by \\(7\\):\n\n\\[\n\\text{Cost in US dollars} = \\frac{105 \\text{ Namibian dollars}}{7} = 15 \\text{ US dollars}\n\\]\n\nNext, we convert the cost of the painting from US dollars to Chinese yuan. We know that 1 US dollar is equivalent to 6 Chinese yuan. Therefore, we can find the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan by multiplying the cost in US dollars by \\(6\\):\n\n\\[\n\\text{Cost in Chinese yuan} = 15 \\text{ US dollars} \\times 6 = 90 \\text{ Chinese yuan}\n\\]\n\nThus, the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan is \\(\\boxed{90}\\).",
